# i18n

- User-facing strings go through `useTranslation` and a namespace (`content`, `factory`, etc.)
- Add every new key to **both** `client/src/i18n/locales/en/` and `.../vi/`
- Do not hardcode Vietnamese or English UI copy in JSX

```tsx
// ✅
const { t } = useTranslation('content');
return <p>{t('prompts.saveError')}</p>;

// ❌
return <p>Failed to save</p>;
```
